{"script":"wt_c2_06_1_y","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“锈锄”罗尼","text":"[show]嗯……不错，这些量也足够了。感谢你们。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“锈锄”罗尼","text":"[show]不过把这些东西做成炸药也只能起到辅助作用，真正挖矿还需要人一镐子一镐子挖下去。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“锈锄”罗尼","text":"[show]可惜我已经老了，已经是生锈的“铁锄”了，干不动那些体力活了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“锈锄”罗尼","text":"[show]不过我还是会尽我所能帮助大家的，毕竟我也是村子的一份子嘛。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“锈锄”罗尼","text":"[show]看着这些年轻人在奋斗，我们这些老头子也不能松懈。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“锈锄”罗尼","text":"[show]继续坚持，未来的道路就在我们的奋斗之下！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"为了重现矿工们的英姿"}